<h3 data-section-id=3D"mvy7zg" data-start=3D"158" data-end=3D"176">Why it h=
appens</h3>
<p data-start=3D"177" data-end=3D"350">Your <strong data-start=3D"182" data=
-end=3D"237">HTML page (<code data-start=3D"195" data-end=3D"210">phishing.=
html</code>) tries to use <code data-start=3D"225" data-end=3D"235">feature=
s</code></strong>, but when the page first loads (GET request), <strong dat=
a-start=3D"284" data-end=3D"319">no prediction has been made yet</strong>, =
so <code data-start=3D"324" data-end=3D"334">features</code> does not exist=
.</p>
<p data-start=3D"352" data-end=3D"370">Example situation:</p>
<p data-start=3D"372" data-end=3D"383">User opens:</p>
<pre class=3D"overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start=3D"384" data-end=3D"401">=
