<p data-start=3D"2280" data-end=3D"2434">So you <strong data-start=3D"2287"=
 data-end=3D"2317">cannot directly feed a URL</strong> and expect perfect p=
redictions unless you implement <strong data-start=3D"2370" data-end=3D"241=
7">full feature extraction for all 30 features</strong>, which requires:</p=
>
<ul data-start=3D"2436" data-end=3D"2504">
