=9F=91=8D</p>
<p data-start=3D"100" data-end=3D"276">Unlike phishing or email detection (=
which used <strong data-start=3D"147" data-end=3D"177">machine learning + d=
ataset</strong>), steganography detection in small projects is often done w=
ith <strong data-start=3D"241" data-end=3D"275">algorithmic analysis of pix=
els</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"278" data-end=3D"281">
<h1 data-section-id=3D"1cc7z2a" data-start=3D"283" data-end=3D"338">How Ste=
ganography Detection Works (No Dataset Needed)</h1>
<p data-start=3D"340" data-end=3D"413">Most hidden-message images use <stro=
ng data-start=3D"371" data-end=3D"402">LSB (Least Significant Bit)</strong>=
 technique.</p>
<p data-start=3D"415" data-end=3D"423">Example:</p>
<p data-start=3D"425" data-end=3D"439">A pixel value:</p>
