<hr data-start=3D"1442" data-end=3D"1445">
<h1 data-section-id=3D"17xpxrr" data-start=3D"1447" data-end=3D"1490">4=EF=
=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 If the Guide Asks =E2=80=9CHow Does It Work?=E2=80=9D</h1>
<p data-start=3D"1492" data-end=3D"1500">You say:</p>
<p data-start=3D"1502" data-end=3D"1685">1=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 The system ext=
racts <strong data-start=3D"1526" data-end=3D"1542">pixel values</strong><b=
r data-start=3D"1542" data-end=3D"1545">
2=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 It checks <strong data-start=3D"1559" data-end=3D"1591"=
>Least Significant Bits (LSB)</strong><br data-start=3D"1591" data-end=3D"1=
594">
3=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 It reconstructs binary data<br data-start=3D"1625" data=
-end=3D"1628">
4=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 Converts binary =E2=86=92 ASCII<br data-start=3D"1655" =
data-end=3D"1658">
5=EF=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 Displays hidden message</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1687" data-end=3D"1690">
<h1 data-section-id=3D"1spjqax" data-start=3D"1692" data-end=3D"1754">5=EF=
=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 If the Guide Asks =E2=80=9CCan It Detect Unknown Steganogra=
phy?=E2=80=9D</h1>
<p data-start=3D"1756" data-end=3D"1768">You can say:</p>
<blockquote data-start=3D"1770" data-end=3D"1954">
<p data-start=3D"1772" data-end=3D"1954">=E2=80=9CAdvanced steganalysis met=
hods like RS analysis, chi-square attack, and CNN-based detection can detec=
t unknown steganography. Our project currently demonstrates LSB-based detec=
tion.=E2=80=9D</p>
</blockquote>
<p data-start=3D"1956" data-end=3D"1990">This shows <strong data-start=3D"1=
967" data-end=3D"1989">research awareness</strong>.</p>
<hr data-start=3D"1992" data-end=3D"1995">
<h1 data-section-id=3D"mcnq23" data-start=3D"1997" data-end=3D"2040">6=EF=
=B8=8F=E2=83=A3 Optional Upgrade (Very Good for Viva)</h1>
