</code>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"132" data-end=3D"370">Right now the extractor is still <st=
rong data-start=3D"165" data-end=3D"197">printing too many characters</stro=
ng> because it reads <strong data-start=3D"215" data-end=3D"240">the entire=
