trong data-start=3D"293" data-end=3D"327">thousands of random characters</s=
trong>, which is what you see in your screenshot.</p>
<p data-start=3D"372" data-end=3D"451">We need to <strong data-start=3D"383=
" data-end=3D"421">limit the extracted message length</strong> and <strong =
data-start=3D"426" data-end=3D"450">classify it properly</strong>.</p>
