<h1 data-section-id=3D"1509qxv" data-start=3D"2595" data-end=3D"2626">Impor=
tant Thing to Understand</h1>
<p data-start=3D"2628" data-end=3D"2750">Your <strong data-start=3D"2633" d=
ata-end=3D"2686">dataset images usually contain encrypted payloads</strong>=
, so the system <strong data-start=3D"2702" data-end=3D"2749">cannot decode=
 them into human-readable text</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2752" data-end=3D"2815">That is <strong data-start=3D"2760=
" data-end=3D"2791">normal and correct behavior</strong> for steganalysis t=
ools.</p>
<p data-start=3D"2817" data-end=3D"2844">Your system already proves:</p>
<p data-start=3D"2846" data-end=3D"2926">=E2=9C=94 Hidden data exists<br da=
ta-start=3D"2866" data-end=3D"2869">
=E2=9C=94 Raw payload extracted<br data-start=3D"2892" data-end=3D"2895">
=E2=9C=94 Message decoded if possible</p>
<p data-start=3D"2928" data-end=3D"2973">Which is <strong data-start=3D"293=
7" data-end=3D"2972">exactly what your guide expects</strong>.</p>
