<p data-start=3D"525" data-end=3D"611">This is <strong data-start=3D"533" d=
ata-end=3D"559">not a readable message</strong>, but the system correctly d=
etected <strong data-start=3D"595" data-end=3D"610">hidden data</strong>.</=
p>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"pf4s5u" data-start=3D"613" data-end=3D"645">What you=
r code currently does</h2>
<p data-start=3D"646" data-end=3D"658">Your system:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"660" data-end=3D"759">
<li data-section-id=3D"7bnfj9" data-start=3D"660" data-end=3D"703">
<p data-start=3D"663" data-end=3D"703">Detects hidden data using the ML mod=
el</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1hu5192" data-start=3D"704" data-end=3D"726">
<p data-start=3D"707" data-end=3D"726">Extracts LSB bits</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"159ojeh" data-start=3D"727" data-end=3D"759">
<p data-start=3D"730" data-end=3D"759">Converts them to characters</p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"761" data-end=3D"828">But since there is <strong data-star=
t=3D"780" data-end=3D"797">no end marker</strong>, it keeps printing charac=
ters.</p>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"7oshvl" data-start=3D"830" data-end=3D"847">The prop=
er fix</h2>
