<h2 data-section-id=3D"1nkcsd3" data-start=3D"155" data-end=3D"184">1=EF=B8=
=8F=E2=83=A3 Real-time upload (YES)</h2>
<p data-start=3D"185" data-end=3D"249">Your Flask app allows a user to <str=
ong data-start=3D"217" data-end=3D"248">upload any image at runtime</strong=
>:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"251" data-end=3D"274">
