<p data-start=3D"269" data-end=3D"274">BMP</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"276" data-end=3D"305">Example workflow in your app:</p>
<ol data-start=3D"307" data-end=3D"480">
<li data-section-id=3D"l3jsrg" data-start=3D"307" data-end=3D"330">
<p data-start=3D"310" data-end=3D"330">User uploads image</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1vanut2" data-start=3D"331" data-end=3D"387">
<p data-start=3D"334" data-end=3D"387">System extracts <strong data-start=
=3D"350" data-end=3D"385">stego features (LSB statistics)</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1xh3zc4" data-start=3D"388" data-end=3D"430">
<p data-start=3D"391" data-end=3D"430">ML model predicts <strong data-start=
=3D"409" data-end=3D"428">stego vs normal</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1rv5og6" data-start=3D"431" data-end=3D"480">
<p data-start=3D"434" data-end=3D"480">If stego =E2=86=92 tries to <strong =
data-start=3D"454" data-end=3D"480">extract hidden message</strong></p>
</li>
</ol>
<p data-start=3D"482" data-end=3D"571">So the <strong data-start=3D"489" da=
ta-end=3D"514">analysis is real-time</strong>, because it processes the ima=
ge <strong data-start=3D"547" data-end=3D"570">when it is uploaded</strong>=
.</p>
